{"agent":"bugs-review-tooling","data":{"body":"Fixes B1ed2b4fde6, B2bf4d38cc1, B1979dac602. (1) gate record gains --reviewed-sha: for standards it is compared with the item's branch head (equal ok, older branch commit warns, anything else refused exit 3) and recorded; the standards prompt and companions note say roborev review <sha>. (2) the review diff of an item tree excludes untracked files and lists them as untracked, not reviewed. (3) gate record --model on a reviewer gate that is in the author's family is refused (exit 3) unless --reviewer-model is used; --reviewer-model is a back-compatible alias that states the model IS the reviewer.","dedupe":{"answer":"new","candidates":[{"id":"B1ed2b4fde6","score":0.346810674},{"id":"B2bf4d38cc1","score":0.296037284},{"id":"B1979dac602","score":0.326760089}],"score":0.346810674},"globs":["ddflow/api/review.py","ddflow/api/gates.py","ddflow/infra/worktree.py","ddflow/services/gates.py","ddflow/surfaces/commands/gates.py","ddflow/surfaces/cli.py","ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py","ddflow/templates/companions.toml","ddflow/templates/drivers/implement-phase.md","docs/ddflow/drivers/implement-phase.md","tests/test_review_gate_integrity.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"","priority":100,"tags":[],"title":"Review and standards gate integrity: reviewed sha, untracked files, reviewer model (fixes bug B1ed2b4fde6, B2bf4d38cc1, B1979dac602)"},"id":"ea6d497af4ac8e77cb84c8693","kind":"task.added","lamport":10886,"schema":1,"subject":"B-fix-review-tooling-integrity","ts":"2026-10-02T18:21:36.462325Z"}
