{"agent":"bugs-review-tooling","data":{"digest":"25a5a83adf42f6b6","finding":1,"gate":"critic","location":"ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py (gate_record schema, `model` property + `model_is_reviewer` derivation)","probe":"Intended contract, not a contradiction: --model/model is the reviewer's model; an author-family value on a reviewer gate is refused by design and the refusal names reviewer_model for a reviewer that really is of that family (tests test_an_author_family_model_on_a_reviewer_gate_is_refused, test_reviewer_model_states_that_the_model_is_the_reviewer).","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py (gate_record schema, `model` property + `model_is_reviewer` derivation)","verdict":"refuted"},"id":"e2fe1b18e2b4f4d85dc5d76ec","kind":"review.triaged","lamport":11086,"schema":1,"subject":"B-fix-review-tooling-integrity","ts":"2026-10-02T18:42:50.063825Z"}
